  "releaseNotes": "* v3.5.0: updates com.squareup.okhttp3, com.squareup.okio, kotlinx-io-core, slf4j.api, Kotlin.Stdlib dependencies.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t* v3.4.0: updates com.squareup.okhttp3, com.squareup.okio, and kotlinx-io-core dependencies.\n\n\t\t\t* v3.3.0: Added Square.OkHttp3.Jvm dependency. OkHttp 5.x split the core classes into the\n\t\t\tcom.squareup.okhttp3:okhttp-jvm coordinate, which Square.OkHttp3 (meta) no longer provides.\n\n\t\t\t* v3.2.0: Updated to Ktor 3.2.0.\n\t\t\t- Square.OkIO.JVM 3.10 -> 3.13 becuase v3.12.0 (natively declared dependency) is missing from NuGet\n\t\t\t- XDev.Slf4j.Api 2.0.16.1 -> 2.0.17.2\n\n\t\t\t* v3.0.0: Updated to Ktor 3.0.0 and retargeted to .NET 9 (net9.0-android).\n\t\t\t* new maven dependencies (pulled in by Ktor 3.0.0):\n\t\t\t- io.ktor:ktor-sse (server-sent events module)\n\t\t\t- com.squareup.okhttp3:okhttp-sse 4.12.0\n\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core 0.5.4\n\t\t\t- org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json-io 1.7.3\n\t\t\t- org.slf4j:slf4j-api bumped to 2.0.x (now pinned directly by Ktor 3 -> XDev.Slf4j.Api)\n\n\t\t\t* v2.3.13\n\t\t\t- last release targeting .NET 8 (net8.0-android).\n\t\t\t- XDev.Jetbrains.KotlinX.Coroutines.Slf4j v 1.7.3.2\n\t\t\t- XDev.Slf4j.Api v 1.7.36.4\n\n\t\t\t- Square.OkIO.JVM 3.10 -> 3.13 becuase v3.12.0 (natively declared dependency) is missing from NuGet\n\t\t\t- XDev.Slf4j.Api 2.0.16.1 -> 2.0.17.2\n\t\t\t- org.slf4j:slf4j-api bumped to 2.0.x (now pinned directly by Ktor 3 -> XDev.Slf4j.Api)",
